/ActualText (Computer Science student at Nahda University \(Class of 2026\) from Beni Suef, Egypt. I designed, built, and secured a company's entire internal PHP/MySQL system end-to-end as the sole engineer, and I combine that full-stack background with hands-on offensive security - hunting vulnerabilities on HackerOne and Bugcrowd, with disclosures recognized in the Halls of Fame of U.S. government and corporate Vulnerability Disclosure Programs. I'm currently looking for roles in software engineering and application security.)
